{
  "$schema": "ai-ratchet-baseline/0.1.0",
  "$comment": "Baseline for npm run lint:ratchet. NEVER auto-updated by a pipeline — a baseline that rewrites itself is a recorder, not a gate. Every change to this file must state, in its commit message, WHY a number moved: fixed, deleted, or the counter broke.",
